    {"id":"circ_notes","type":"text","x":-490,"y":155,"width":680,"height":75,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#2f9e44","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a47","roundness":null,"seed":348,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"locked":false,"text":"Loop prevention: every write tagged with originating node ID. When write returns to\nthat node, it recognizes its own ID and drops it. No infinite loop.\n✗  One node failure breaks the whole ring. C dies = A cannot reach D at all.","rawText":"Loop prevention: every write tagged with originating node ID. When write returns to\nthat node, it recognizes its own ID and drops it. No infinite loop.\n✗  One node failure breaks the whole ring. C dies = A cannot reach D at all.","fontSize":20,"fontFamily":8,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Loop prevention: every write tagged with originating node ID. When write returns to\nthat node, it recognizes its own ID and drops it. No infinite loop.\n✗  One node failure breaks the whole ring. C dies = A cannot reach D at all.","autoResize":false,"lineHeight":1.25}
